Paredit 0.2.1: preserve string context when detecting line comments, preserve
original line endings in document text and cursor offsets, and traverse
comments and complete strings when finding slurp/barf destinations.

Base: https://github.com/quasarbright/vscode-paredit/commit/dcc13c5cf5438ca3236e1c7b46f3bbd089337817
License: MIT; see paredit-LICENSE.txt.

